#: ../../about.rst:1
msgid "About this manual"
msgstr "このマニュアルについて"

#: ../../about.rst:4
msgid ""
"This manual describes the implemented tool and its deliberate limits. The "
"separate GDS project records proposals, decisions, and review history. A "
"proposal's state is not changed by making its typography better."
msgstr ""
"このマニュアルでは、実装済みの機能と意図的な制約を説明します。提案、決定、レビュー履歴は、別の GDS "
"プロジェクトに記録します。組版を改善しても、提案の状態は変わりません。"

#: ../../about.rst:8
msgid ""
"The organization follows a practical documentation pattern: learn with "
"tutorials, understand with topic guides, act with practical tasks, and "
"check details in reference pages. Internals explain the invariants and "
"proofs."
msgstr ""
"実際の使い方に沿って構成しています。チュートリアルで学び、トピックガイドで理解し、手順ガイドで作業し、リファレンスで詳細を確認します。内部実装の章では、不変条件と証明を説明します。"

#: ../../about.rst:12
msgid ""
"The prose favors small examples, named assumptions, and direct "
"statements. The aim is an explanation that another person can test. The "
"design uses restrained color, strong headings, serif reading text, and "
"accessible navigation. It does not imitate an author's words or layout."
msgstr ""
"小さな例を使い、前提を明示し、要点を直接述べます。読者が自分で確かめられる説明を目指しています。控えめな配色、明確な見出し、読みやすいセリフ体、使いやすいナビゲーションを採用しています。特定の著者の文章やレイアウトをまねるものではありません。"

#: ../../about.rst:17
msgid ""
"This project was created with ``guidedog quickstart`` and is built by "
"Guidedog. RST holds the prose. Graphviz holds the diagrams. LaTeX math "
"notation holds equations. Typst remains only where a PDF typesetting "
"template is required."
msgstr ""
"このプロジェクトは ``guidedog quickstart`` で作成し、Guidedog でビルドしています。本文は RST、図は "
"Graphviz、数式は LaTeX の数学記法で記述します。Typst を使うのは PDF の組版テンプレートだけです。"

#: ../../about.rst:21
msgid "Implementation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../about.rst:24
msgid ""
"Guidedog 0.7 is a port of the original Odin implementation to Rust. The "
"port keeps the user-facing behavior: the ``guidedog`` commands and "
"options, ``conf.toml`` keys, directives, roles, and output. It redesigns "
"the inside the way a Rust program is written: ownership instead of arenas "
"and allocation budgets, traits instead of procedure tables, and one crate "
"per responsibility. :doc:`internals/index` describes the result. "
":doc:`internals/engine-api-map` maps the Odin engine's names to the Rust "
"ones."
msgstr ""

#: ../../about.rst:32
msgid ""
"The port adds Rust API documentation (:doc:`rust`), plugins linked into a "
"custom binary (:doc:`plugins`), and a guided GitHub Pages workflow "
"(:doc:`howto/github-pages`). Odin remains a documented language: the Odin "
"domain and its API pages are unchanged (:doc:`odin`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../about.rst:37
msgid "Build evidence and qualification"
msgstr "ビルドと検証の記録"

#: ../../about.rst:40
msgid ""
"Release 0.6.3 of the Odin implementation passed its integration and "
"library suites, AddressSanitizer checks, five-platform builds and smoke "
"tests, and twelve large-manual builds across CPython, Django, and Flask. "
"Diagnostic and link results matched their established baselines. Those "
"records are kept in the repository's ``docs/manual/evidence`` folder as "
"history. The Rust implementation keeps the conformance tests and expected "
"outputs (:doc:`internals/rst-conformance`, "
":doc:`internals/commonmark-conformance`). Its own large-manual "
"measurements are recorded as new evidence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../about.rst:49
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Earlier publisher compatibility is no longer a release requirement. "
#| "Qualification checks (via ``guidedog plugin check``) demonstrate "
#| "interoperability across process boundaries; directly linked native "
#| "callbacks remain trusted code."
msgid ""
"Qualification checks (via ``guidedog plugin check``) show that plugins "
"work across process boundaries. Linked plugins remain trusted code."
msgstr ""
"旧版の公開プラグインとの互換性は、リリース要件ではありません。``guidedog plugin check`` "
"はプロセス間の相互運用を検証します。直接リンクするネイティブコールバックは、引き続き信頼するコードとして扱います。"

#: ../../about.rst:52
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "That evidence supports the released tool and its documented surface. "
#| "It is not a claim of universal Sphinx equivalence or unbounded memory "
#| "safety. See :doc:`compatibility` for the retained limits."
msgid ""
"That evidence supports the released tool and its documented surface. It "
"is not a claim of universal Sphinx equivalence. See :doc:`compatibility` "
"for the retained limits."
msgstr ""
"この記録が裏付けるのは、公開済みのツールと文書化された機能です。Sphinx "
"との完全な同等性や、条件を問わないメモリ安全性を保証するものではありません。制限は :doc:`compatibility` を参照してください。"

#: ../../about.rst:55
msgid ""
"Documentation maintenance commands are in :doc:`howto/maintain-docs`."
msgstr "ドキュメントの保守に使うコマンドは :doc:`howto/maintain-docs` にまとめています。"

